WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.026
Is globalisation making nation-states irrelevant?

2
00:00:04.026 --> 00:00:06.316
Scholars give three answers.

3
00:00:06.655 --> 00:00:09.262
Hyperglobalists say states are fading.

4
00:00:09.262 --> 00:00:11.108
Sceptics say nothing much is

5
00:00:11.108 --> 00:00:13.853
new. Transformationalists say states are

6
00:00:13.853 --> 00:00:15.927
changing, not vanishing.

7
00:00:16.274 --> 00:00:19.512
The World Trade Organization began

8
00:00:19.512 --> 00:00:20.845
in 1995,

9
00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:23.977
a symbol of economic globalisation.

10
00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:26.642
Developing countries saw gains in

11
00:00:26.642 --> 00:00:28.453
growth and technology.

12
00:00:28.453 --> 00:00:30.643
And worries about inequality and

13
00:00:30.643 --> 00:00:32.630
loss of policy space.

14
00:00:32.962 --> 00:00:34.233
Your turn.

15
00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:36.182
Which view is this?
